  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p><strong>Aura</strong> faint Protection; <strong>CL</strong> 5th<br>\n<strong>Slot</strong> none; <strong>Price</strong> 500 gp; <strong>Weight</strong> 0.1 lbs.</p>\n<p><strong>Description</strong><br>\nThis grenade is thrown as a thrown splash weapon. Instead of dealing damage, it creates a 35-foot radius field of force centered on the target. Creatures within 5 feet of the field’s boundary are shunted to the nearest empty space, and must succeed a DC 12 Reflex save or take 3d6 force damage. The field of force has 9 hit points, a Break DC of 17, and remains in place for 5 rounds or until destroyed, whichever comes first. In all other respects, the field of force is treated as a barrier created with the Protection sphere.</p>\n<p><strong>Construction Requirements</strong><br>\nDistill Compound, Protection sphere (Distant Protection); <strong>Cost</strong> 250 gp</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/compounds#toc41\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
